## 📊 DATA MODELS

### Participant
- `Id`: Unique identifier
- `Name`: Participant name (required)
- `Email`: Email address (required)
- `ProfileStatus`: Registration status
- `Skills`: Collection of proficiency-tagged skills
- `Interests`: Project interests
- `Teams`: Team assignments

### Team
- `Id`: Unique identifier
- `Name`: Team name
- `EventId`: Associated event
- `Status`: Draft/Suggested/Locked/Finalized
- `IsLocked`: Prevents auto-matching changes
- `Members`: Participant list

### Skill
- `Id`: Unique identifier
- `Name`: Skill name
- `Category`: Skill classification (Frontend, Backend, Data, Design, DevOps)
- `ParticipantSkills`: Usage references

### AuditLog
- `Timestamp`: When change occurred
- `Event`: What happened (ParticipantAdded, ParticipantMoved, TeamLocked, etc.)
- `Actor`: Who made the change (System/Organizer name)
- `OldValue`: Previous state
- `NewValue`: New state
- `TeamId`: Associated team (if applicable)

